<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/phocas" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/phocas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/november-27">27 November</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">The usurper Phocas has the deposed emperor Maurice executed</h3><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phocas">Phocas</a>, leader of the army mutiny that had overthrown Emperor Maurice, had Maurice's five sons executed and then Maurice himself. The murder gave the Sasanian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khosrow-ii">Khosrow II</a> a pretext for a long war that exhausted both empires.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maurice-emperor">Maurice</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phocas">Phocas</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
